<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Blue-Green Deployment Architecture</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    background: #0f172a;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    padding: 24px 16px;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 22px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }
  .subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .stage {
    background: #1e293b;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
  }
  .stage-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .stage-num {
    background: #6366f1;
    color: white;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .url-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .url-box {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 2px solid;
  }
  .url-prod { background: #1e3a5f; border-color: #3b82f6; color: #93c5fd; }
  .url-pvt { background: #422006; border-color: #f59e0b; color: #fcd34d; }
  .arrow {
    text-align: center;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 4px 0;
  }
  .services-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .service-box {
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    border: 1px dashed #475569;
    background: #0f172a;
  }
  .service-label {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .selector {
    font-family: 'SF Mono', monospace;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .deployments {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .deploy-box {
    padding: 14px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 2px solid;
  }
  .blue { background: #1e3a5f; border-color: #3b82f6; }
  .green { background: #14532d; border-color: #22c55e; }
  .deploy-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .deploy-status { font-size: 10px; opacity: 0.85; }
  .pods { font-size: 16px; margin-top: 6px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .live-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #22c55e;
    color: #052e16;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .test-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #f59e0b;
    color: #422006;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .swap-note {
    background: #422006;
    border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #fde68a;
    margin-top: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .stage-2 .deploy-box.blue,
  .stage-2 .url-prod { opacity: 0.5; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Blue-Green Deployment</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Two services, label-selector swap, zero downtime</p>

<!-- STAGE 1: Initial state -->

<div class="stage">
  <div class="stage-title"><span class="stage-num">1</span> Before swap — Blue is live</div>

  <div class="url-row">
    <div class="url-box url-prod">app.company.com (prod users)</div>
    <div class="url-box url-pvt">app-pvt.company.com (testers)</div>
  </div>

  <div class="arrow">↓</div>

  <div class="services-row">
    <div class="service-box">
      <div class="service-label">prod-service</div>
      <div class="selector">selector: blue</div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-box">
      <div class="service-label">pvt-service</div>
      <div class="selector">selector: green</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="arrow">↓</div>

  <div class="deployments">
    <div class="deploy-box blue">
      <div class="deploy-name">Deployment Blue<span class="live-tag">LIVE</span></div>
      <div class="deploy-status">v1.0 — current release</div>
      <div class="pods">🟦 🟦 🟦</div>
    </div>
    <div class="deploy-box green">
      <div class="deploy-name">Deployment Green<span class="test-tag">TEST</span></div>
      <div class="deploy-status">v1.1 — being tested</div>
      <div class="pods">🟩 🟩 🟩</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- STAGE 2: After swap -->

<div class="stage stage-2">
  <div class="stage-title"><span class="stage-num">2</span> After swap — Green promoted to prod</div>

  <div class="url-row">
    <div class="url-box url-prod">app.company.com (prod users)</div>
    <div class="url-box url-pvt">app-pvt.company.com (testers)</div>
  </div>

  <div class="arrow">↓</div>

  <div class="services-row">
    <div class="service-box">
      <div class="service-label">prod-service</div>
      <div class="selector">selector: green ✏️</div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-box">
      <div class="service-label">pvt-service</div>
      <div class="selector">selector: blue (next)</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="arrow">↓</div>

  <div class="deployments">
    <div class="deploy-box blue">
      <div class="deploy-name">Deployment Blue</div>
      <div class="deploy-status">v1.0 — idle / next test target</div>
      <div class="pods">🟦 🟦 🟦</div>
    </div>
    <div class="deploy-box green">
      <div class="deploy-name">Deployment Green<span class="live-tag">LIVE</span></div>
      <div class="deploy-status">v1.1 — now in production</div>
      <div class="pods">🟩 🟩 🟩</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="swap-note">
    <strong>The swap:</strong> a single <code>kubectl patch</code> on prod-service flips its selector from blue → green. New traffic routes instantly to green pods, in-flight requests on blue finish gracefully. No restart, no downtime.
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>